<title>USA: IPO PRICING - SEEC Inc prices at $7.25.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - SEEC Inc prices at $7.25.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			     SEEC Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At				     $7.25</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	    $6 - $7.50</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			1,800,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter   H.C. Wainwright &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The company increased the proposed number of shares for its planned initial public offering to 1.8 million from 1.0 million shares previously.</p>
<p>Lead underwriter H.C. Wainwright &amp; Co Inc said the initial public offering is not yet effective.</p>
